### 6. Context Shifting (KV Cache Overflow Handling)

**Where:** `server-context.cpp:2533-2600`

```cpp
if (slot.state == SLOT_STATE_GENERATING && slot.prompt.n_tokens() + 1 >= slot.n_ctx) {
    if (!params_base.ctx_shift) {
        // Generation already stopped in process_token() — this is redundant
        send_error(slot, "context shift is disabled", ERROR_TYPE_SERVER);
        slot.release();
        continue;
